'''VARREL''' is a [[:Category:Japan|Japanese]] esports organization based in [[:wikipedia:Yokohama|Yokohama]]. 

On October 15th, 2020, Japanese video game developer/publisher [https://www.donuts.ne.jp/ Donuts Co. Ltd.] acquired the organization, and renamed the organization from '''Unsold Stuff Gaming''' to '''Donuts Unsold Stuff Gaming'''. On December 23rd, 2022, the organization rebranded once again, this time it was renamed to '''VARREL'''.<ref name="Donuts USG rebrand">{{cite web|url=https://usgd.club/news/2022/12/23/2543|title=「DONUTS USG」が「VARREL」へ社名変更|trans_title="DONUTS USG" changed its name to "VARREL"|lang=jp|author='''Donuts USG'''|date=2022-12-23}}</ref>

On October 15th, 2025, '''VARREL''' separated from [https://www.donuts.ne.jp/ Donuts Co. Ltd.]'s consolidated subsidiaries and became independent under [https://cellorb.jp/ CELLORB]'s operation.

